{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-light-cones","chapterId":"item-ItemConfigEquipment-23008","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-23008-item-ItemConfigEquipment-23008-0","text":"丰饶命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","speaker":""},{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-23008-item-ItemConfigEquipment-23008-1","text":"白色鸢尾旁，他叩打着棺材。\n「有时我觉得，和你做这个交易，是我看轻你了。」\n无人回应，只有棘刺毫不犹豫地穿透他的掌心。\n但他也笑着，抓住了棘刺。\n\n「就是这样，我们都想利用彼此，然而我们都看轻了对方。」","speaker":""}]}
